{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統當勞·特朗普11月20日公開表示，美國政府將阻止美國科技企業在海外建設數據中心，或者對這些企業徵收「巨額税款」（Tremendous Tax）。這一表態意味着，特朗普政府可能進一步將人工智能基礎設施建設納入美國本土產業政策，試圖把數據中心投資、先進計算能力以及相關經濟收益儘可能留在美國境內。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587330.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T19:44:38.434945+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T19:29:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T19:37:33.264422+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T19:37:33.264422+00:00","content_hash":"144fa789f61fd53a72570095ea79d9bfc09a4fc9c5e3a98f6fe25f18058bf2d3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}